  "cmd_name": "list-personal-numbers-of-user",
  "deprecated": false,
  "description_en": "You can invoke ListPersonalNumbersOfUser to obtain the list of personal outbound numbers for a specified agent under a specified instance. You can also use this API to retrieve the list of numbers that can be added as personal outbound numbers for an agent",
