      "help_en": "Indicates whether the phone numbers are associated with the agent. If true, the API queries the list of personal outbound phone numbers associated with the UserId. If false, it queries the list of personal outbound phone numbers that can be associated with but are not currently associated with the UserId. This parameter is typically used together with the AddPersonalNumbersToUser API",
